 X 21′ dance floors <\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"37afe09d-e6c1-4ab3-b02e-886b131010a1":{"type":"background-image-text","disabled":true,"settings":{"subtitle":"","title":"simple and effective tiles","text":"<p>Attractive event flooring that is easy to install.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Slate_Black_Tap_Studio.webp","focal_point":"center","layout":"left","height":650,"framed":true,"parallax":false,"parallax_direction":"top"}},"testimonials":{"type":"testimonials","blocks":{"testimonials-0":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-1":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}},"testimonials-2":{"type":"testimonial","settings":{"icon":"5-stars","testimonial":"<p>Add customer reviews and testimonials to showcase your store’s happy customers.<\/p>","author":"Author's name","author_info":"Los Angeles, CA"}}},"block_order":["testimonials-0","testimonials-1","testimonials-2"],"disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"Testimonials","align_text":"center","round_images":true,"color_background":"#f9f9f9","color_text":"#1c1d1d"}},"8dee5b19-f3b7-478f-9187-7d6dbce1c9ab":{"type":"hero-video","disabled":true,"settings":{"title":"SNOW, MUD\n& DAMAGE","title_size":60,"subheading":"CONTAIN THEM WITH THE FLOOR DEFENDER","link_text":"","link":"","color_accent":"rgba(0,0,0,0)","text_align":"vertical-bottom horizontal-right","video_url":"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/videos\/c\/o\/v\/205bf0dd43474cadbc436af39a1133dd.mp4","overlay_opacity":0,"section_height":"650px","mobile_height":"auto"}},"f7c3225f-e625-4856-a697-866928ef710b":{"type":"rich-text","settings":{"align_text":"center","narrow_column":true,"divider":false}},"1148b4e3-2cf6-42af-910e-9aa29caa2a70":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 22px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_19T11_29_52_387Z.png","image_width":700,"subtitle":"","title":"Comfort Flow Drainage Mat","text":"<p>Comfort Flow mats with its anti-fatigue properties is perfect to improve your employee's morale and productivity as these mats are designed to be ergonomic and comfortable in wet environments<\/p>","button_label":"shop now","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/comfort-flow-mat","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"f2f4d304-6a8f-48b3-a6cd-0466dc6e11bd":{"type":"text-and-image","disabled":true,"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_11T09_24_19_294Z.png","image_width":700,"subtitle":"GARAGE FLOOR PROTECTION","title":"NO MUDDY MESS","text":"<p>Dirt, Dust, and Debris are no problem as the Floor Defender Containment Mat catches it all and keeps it from being tracked into the house.<\/p><p>The Floor Defenders will hold up to 62 gallons of water at once and keep it off your floors until you are ready to safely empty it outside your garage.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"eb425157-7e74-4ce4-b5a2-de0d4143220d":{"type":"text-columns","blocks":{"template--14487882727553__eb425157-7e74-4ce4-b5a2-de0d4143220d-167922577021c7a07a-0":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_114_0e9885ae-a9fe-47fc-8e21-2af0fbd5970d.png","image_width":650,"title":"DURA FLEX 150 INTERLOCK MATS","text":"<p>These mats are made of rubber with small air pockets designed to allow air flow and evaporation of moisture from underneath the mat. These anti-fatigue mats are ideal for indoor areas with heavy activity, such as gyms and warehouses. These mats are available in two textures, smooth and diamond.<\/p>","button_label":"buy dura flex 150 interlock mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/dura-flex-150-comfort-stand-interlocking-anti-fatigue-mats"}},"template--14487882727553__eb425157-7e74-4ce4-b5a2-de0d4143220d-167922577021c7a07a-1":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_115_3cac82b6-8d9d-4627-9a9e-2faa1b793943.png","image_width":650,"title":"DURA FLEX 200 ANTI-FATIGUE BUBBLE MATS","text":"<p>These mats are constructed of dense rubber which is molded into a bubbled texture on both the facing and backing. This texture allows air to flow underneath the mat which reduces fatigue and provides a comfortable feeling underfoot. These heavy-duty mats are made to withstand rigorous use in industrial areas.<\/p>","button_label":"buy dura flex 200 anti-fatigue mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/dura-flex-200-anti-fatigue-bubble-mats"}},"template--14487882727553__eb425157-7e74-4ce4-b5a2-de0d4143220d-167922577021c7a07a-2":{"type":"text_block","settings":{"enable_image":true,"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_113_5294c290-bdf9-4d6c-afa9-1b1cccca7aaf.png","image_width":650,"title":"CM VIPER DRAIN THROUGH MATS","text":"<p>These mats are slip resistant with open hole tread to scrape away dirt and allow water to drain through, making them perfect for use in commercial environments with heavy traffic. CM Viper Drain Through Mats are extremely durable, stable and slip resistant as well as immune to mold and mildew<\/p>","button_label":"buy cm viper drain through mats","button_link":"shopify:\/\/products\/cm-viper-drain-through-mats"}}},"block_order":["template--14487882727553__eb425157-7e74-4ce4-b5a2-de0d4143220d-167922577021c7a07a-0","template--14487882727553__eb425157-7e74-4ce4-b5a2-de0d4143220d-167922577021c7a07a-1","template--14487882727553__eb425157-7e74-4ce4-b5a2-de0d4143220d-167922577021c7a07a-2"],"custom_css":[],"settings":{"title":"","align_text":"center","divider":false}},"3eb2f88f-12e5-4f87-aabb-ad99d885f103":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 25px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_2023_03_19T11_49_35_662Z.png","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Long-lasting rubber construction","text":"<p>Our anti-fatigue mats are made of rubber and designed to last. Rubber is extremely durable and will hold its shape for years. It can withstand all weather conditions making them perfect for both indoor and outdoor applications<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"left","divider":false}},"9d8d2f29-27b5-4648-b084-5ca9f0b9964b":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 25px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_116_540x_db722526-302d-4366-a7a6-44bef646cc44.webp","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Comfortable non-slip surfaces","text":"<p>Featuring non-slip surfaces, these mats provide both traction and underfoot comfort to maximize productivity in the workplace. Ensure your environment is optimized for safety and efficiency.<\/p>","button_label":"","button_link":"","button_label2":"","button_link2":"","button_style":"primary","align_text":"left","layout":"right","divider":false}},"49e1522d-4e00-4356-91df-3d3dbada5a3e":{"type":"text-and-image","custom_css":[".h1,h1 {font-size: calc(var(--typeHeaderSize) * 0.85); font-weight: bold; font-size: 25px;}"],"settings":{"image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image_111_540x_51f0121b-bf74-4b0f-8781-ef8d228d177f.webp","image_width":500,"subtitle":"","title":"Designed to reduce fatigue","t